{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_title", "source_sha256": "43dbce5f48ec9bcdaeee6519b891051315e24868357950dcc1e08cd84bb923a7", "ja": "正義の魔法使い？", "zh": "正义的魔法使？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "57335af11f04126ba6d554646a070ecb8cdbd766e155f4091e9bc61fccbb213f", "ja": "『魔法学園』シリーズの続編ドラマが決定、\nその主題歌のリリースイベントに出演する\n百合子と風花。ドラマ本編にちなんだ朗読劇\nを披露するアイドル達の一幕です。", "zh": "《魔法学园》系列续作电视剧已经确定，百合子和风花将参加其主题曲的发行活动。这是偶像们根据电视剧正篇内容，表演朗读剧的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6ec13313aa3601ae8eb371feb9fe31fc69288c9338f616af892f4dfe1dfa1c23", "ja": "（「魔法学園」ドラマの主題歌が発売になった。今日は\n百合子と風花が、リリースイベントに出演している）", "zh": "（《魔法学园》电视剧的主题曲已经发售。今天，百合子和风花正在参加发售纪念活动）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "d73afa7032195f8ca781cdcbf0fa3483c4fe4b5f1f8588a93783dd7bf42571ba", "ja": "さてと。これで、邪魔者は消えましたね……。\nさあ風花さん、私と戦ってください♪", "zh": "好了。这样一来，碍事的人就消失了呢……\n来吧，风花小姐，请和我一决胜负吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "dd3a016cb4d3dc9260d64b2d9f613c38aa4e9964021f759dc3ac24ecc2ab21d0", "ja": "百合子……お願い。考え直してちょうだい。", "zh": "百合子……求你了。请重新考虑一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "3caa10a74e34524e67056b90e0a3c0970aaa4f20fbd450372b94a8a8d51aa90a", "ja": "考え直す？　何をですか？", "zh": "重新考虑？要重新考虑什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "682884048dac1b3c157ec3e6d58f891553d61abc2c073f1515140384399c7294", "ja": "……歌織を離してくれれば、これ以上何も追求しない。\n魔法書庫に入ったことも、先生方には黙ってる。", "zh": "……只要你放开歌织，我就不再追究任何事情。\n擅自进入魔法书库的事，我也不会告诉老师们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "545fa51687b3adbba9417f5e7f27e031305185d57360e4f70012da71f7f36c45", "ja": "そもそも、私たちが争う理由なんてどこにもない。\nそうでしょう？", "zh": "说到底，我们根本没有任何争斗的理由。\n不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "2f1433220c994c31f5c84181cb2052c43f5a5259e30129a7925ffc82dabc11e2", "ja": "そうですか？\n私は、あると思いますけど……。", "zh": "是这样吗？\n但我觉得，还是有的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "e993e4f1c8e56dba5254f85f4d0d9b7e47fa08ecf86e09e3271c29f60e35e7dc", "ja": "風花さんだって、それは\nよく知ってるんじゃないですか？", "zh": "风花小姐不是也很清楚吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d11f7481b30d6579a3ccf2adef54c516fd279737f999bf03399a1edece141d51", "ja": "……どうしても、戦わなくちゃダメなの？", "zh": "……无论如何，都非得战斗不可吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "d2a4d9c48dd2bd143ade29e73703daac6e359a490ad2746dd17bcab4e415b02f", "ja": "ええ、風花さん。\n今、歌織さんをお返しする訳にはいかないので。", "zh": "是的，风花小姐。\n现在还不能把歌织小姐还回去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "69fa0b6a11739e7a37f0fd766f6112f3d4710ad5e7be230e49a0bd9fd56f2a8a", "ja": "それに理由なんて、あってもなくても同じかと。\nだって、私たちは『魔法使い』なんですよ？", "zh": "而且，我觉得理由什么的，有没有都一样吧。\n因为，我们可是“魔法使”啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "48e1dbc88340f2eadc22bcd4b2f1246d56709e22ddcd0b3c68330b80dd17c6b0", "ja": "優れた魔法使いなら、己の力を示さなくては。\n貴方のパートナーだった、彼女のように。ね？", "zh": "优秀的魔法师，就必须展现自己的力量。就像曾经做过你搭档的她一样。对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6ead646e4a41e787fec22b450d15e69864150faafdb416fb03482b75407e95be", "ja": "……。\nあなたとは、相容れなさそうね。", "zh": "……\n看来我和你合不来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "fd904c4f06ef0f5506289f37a15dfb389632d253da51a0d9c2c07b2532ba4a8f", "ja": "奇遇ですね！　私もそう思います♪", "zh": "真巧呢！我也是这么想的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "17723925c8b4990d85d1470d3ca832e867ba35269773a904614554efe39aca54", "ja": "風花、百合子、お疲れ様！\n魔法学園の朗読劇、お客さんも喜んでたな。", "zh": "风花、百合子，辛苦了！魔法学园的朗读剧，观众们也都很开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "e6807f325bc39cd561b0afa4ab92bfceafc54c9cb07086dd0277676b94d5ed4e", "ja": "はい！　撮影と違ってやり直しができないので、\nちょっと緊張しましたけど。楽しかったです♪", "zh": "是的！和拍摄不同，朗读剧没法重来，所以稍微有点紧张，不过还是很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "007f394354200412aa79921f45d353f1fdc015fd447a6ef70f0997a354a211e1", "ja": "私も、とっても楽しかったなぁ……♪\nこうしてふたりで話すのも、なんだか新鮮だったね。", "zh": "我也特别开心……♪\n像这样两个人聊天，感觉也挺新鲜的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "a26f8187e5150aa1e34e90d8a7345dd8e8a27225ae1f7fa8c43954f4c6c41dd8", "ja": "そうですね。衣装があんまりにもセクシーで、\n最初はちょっと戸惑っちゃいましたけど……。", "zh": "是啊。服装实在太性感了，  \n一开始还让我有点不知所措，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "ad33c97e8c8a8e37849a78d701e4cce727c6353e7e422910b6fd512ae6de55b3", "ja": "風花さんの衣装も、大人っぽくてセクシーですよね。\n魔法使いとしての格が、一段も二段も違う気がします！", "zh": "风花小姐的服装也很成熟性感呢。作为魔法师的格调，感觉比我高出一两个层次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b188627b3ce16bbda49e9ac76c06c11a2057d179ee9baeb4e612a2bc87cc3027", "ja": "本当？　ありがとう、百合子ちゃん♪", "zh": "真的？谢谢你，百合子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5fa2e1b59945104da7d05a1233a2acfd64d475a5dd320ccb0a64971f708fb0c6", "ja": "私も、今回の衣装はとってもうれしくて……\nすごく気に入ってるんだ♪", "zh": "我也特别喜欢这次的服装……\n真的很喜欢呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "9e6cb86a3f046c28800f2da9e7eb5a31b37e8c6477c10d2be0da31a7d6a4f4e4", "ja": "あれ、そうなのか？", "zh": "咦，是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6f508a0ad392ba010ee68827d060b78cd303cc24d308618c2179edda3320bcf2", "ja": "はい！　それに……\n何といっても、『正義側の魔法使い』ですし！", "zh": "是的！而且……\n不管怎么说，我可是“正义一方的魔法师”嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0c6f875c309a9b5b29c2269153d6b7e8b5ec896ca9b10b26182dfbb8cbee664d", "ja": "私、悪の組織の女幹部とか、悪い魔女の役とか\n多かったから。正義側ってだけで、うれしくて……。", "zh": "我以前演反派组织的女干部啊、邪恶女巫之类的角色比较多。光是能演正义一方，就已经很开心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1025_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3b2c9a9480d0534fba8a04244b7952032346b8281e341ffff80643b6f76432d8", "ja": "あっ……ごめんなさい。\nつい、嬉し涙が……。", "zh": "啊……对不起。\n不小心就喜极而泣了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "49ac2c96fc0cc82d6c6e4a6a5c08a8eb38f084f9679062b7001e3dffd578f518", "ja": "風花さん……喜ぶハードルが、\n下がっちゃってませんか……？", "zh": "风花小姐……您开心的门槛，是不是变低了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "a095d7a5999afe2362be27bc743543cf58f92b808d689421c490042bc3c1ce63", "ja": "（……責任を感じるな……）", "zh": "（……感觉我有责任啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "3db40d2bc3246c8ee7bf42664aabf4e461067f6450a433c1087b010c5b405a02", "ja": "{$P$}さん。責任取って、\n風花さんに正義の味方とか取ってあげてくださいね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。您可要负起责任，\n替风花小姐争取个正义的伙伴之类的角色哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "feb499654c84344631f1474be8a147fc1452de80bdf9166bfc8ff6ff64804d34", "ja": "そうだな……うん。\n正義の味方っぽい役を取ってくるよ……。", "zh": "是啊……嗯。  \n我会去争取一个像正义伙伴那样的角色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1030_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8091820d30b164304261a6e0b65729469e2aac8bd00ff296a880853c23d83a71", "ja": "わぁ、本当ですか！？\nありがとうございます、その時はがんばります！", "zh": "哇，真的吗！？\n谢谢您，到时候我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_250_er_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_250_er_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "bfb5a7a1d2d10003d2aea59e9f0566c8e5ae3d8061902bf83d7d14cc70ef5324", "ja": "（百合子にも風花にも、いい仕事だったみたいだ。\n魔法学園の物語、まだまだ続くといいな！）", "zh": "（对百合子和风花来说，似乎都是一份很不错的工作。希望魔法学园的故事能继续下去啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
